    .goto Loch Modan,30.0,25.0
    >>North Loch Modan: Silver Stream Mine (35,18) troggs, Stonewrought Dam (48,17) - Kobolds, the Algaz station (24,18) 등산가 퀘스트
step
    .goto Loch Modan,65.0,65.0
    >>남동쪽: Ironband's Excavation Site 트로그(65,64), Mo'grosh orcs(70,20) 및 Bloodfang / 산돼지 팩
